{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_53_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年，春，王三月，刻桓宮桷。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"禮，天子之桷，斫之礱之，加密石焉。諸侯之桷，斫之礱之。大夫斫之，士斫本。刻桷，非正也。夫人，所以崇宗廟也。取非禮與非正，而加之於宗廟，以飾夫人，非正也。刻桓宮桷，丹桓宮楹，斥言桓宮以惡莊也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"二、葬曹莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"三、夏，公如齊迎女。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"親迎，恒事也，不志。此其志何也？不其正親迎於齊也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"四、秋，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"迎者，行見諸，舍見諸。先至，非正也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"五、八月，丁丑，夫人姜氏入。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"入者，內弗受也。日入，惡入者也。何用不受也？以宗廟弗受也。其以宗廟弗受何也？娶仇人子弟，以薦舍於前，其義不可受也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"六、戊寅，大夫宗婦覿，用幣。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"覿，見也。禮，大夫不見夫人，不言及不正。其行婦道，故列數之也。男子之贄，羔雁雉腒。婦人之贄，棗栗鍜脩。用幣，非禮也。用者，不宜用者也。大夫，國體也，而行婦道，惡之，故謹而日之也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"七、大水。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"八、冬，戎侵曹。曹羈出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"九、赤歸於曹。郭公。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_53_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_53","textTraditional":"赤蓋郭公也，何為名也？禮，諸侯無外歸之義，外歸，非正也。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}